summary:
  The exec handler no longer hands the loudness engine its commands'
  answers.

history:
  The helper is started on the write's answer and the number is read off the
  run's. Without the way home the address is written into a file and stays
  there.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              if (loudness.handleExec(cmd, stdout)) return;

replace:
              if (false && loudness.handleExec(cmd, stdout)) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_loudness_engine_has_its_instance_its_answers_and_its_sweep.
  Line-neutral.
